We have an old book.
It is called The Little Prince.
It was written by a French writer in 1942.
Our book is kept in the study.
It has belonged to our family for a long time.
The book was bought by my grandmother many years ago.
Recently It was damaged by a visitor.
She tried to take notes and draw pictures on it.
My dad was shocked.
Now he has put the book away and we are not allowed to touch it.